1: /**
2:  * AgentCore Runtime Entry Point
3:  *
4:  * Implements the AgentCore HTTP protocol contract:
5:  *   POST /invocations  — run agent, return SSE stream
6:  *   GET  /ping         — health check
7:  *
8:  * Data flow:
9:  *   1. Backend prepares full workspace locally and uploads to S3
10:  *   2. Backend invokes AgentCore with S3 bucket/prefix in payload
11:  *   3. Container downloads entire workspace from S3 → /workspace/
12:  *   4. Runs Claude Agent SDK with cwd=/workspace
13:  *   5. SDK hooks (PostToolUse + Stop) sync /workspace changes back to S3
14:  *
15:  * Note: file-watcher.ts has been replaced by Claude Code SDK hooks
16:  * registered in agent-runner.ts. The hooks provide more precise,
17:  * event-driven S3 sync (per-file on Write/Edit, full sync on Stop).
18:  */
